     * Documented: cleanup: Whether to cleanup the domain's document_root directory during the publication process. * 1
     * — Remove previous files in domain's document_root directory during the publication process. * 0 — Do not
     * remove any files in domain's document_root directory during the publication process. Omission retains the
     * documented server default 0.
